  × The item variable is undeclared.
  
     9 │     {@render card(label)}
    10 │ {:else}
  > 11 │     {item} {i} {label} {@render card(1)}
       │      ^^^^
    12 │ {/each}
    13 │ {value}
  
  i Using an undeclared variable at runtime can throw a ReferenceError. It often points to a typo or a missing import.
  
  i Declare or import the variable, or fix its name.
  
  i By default, Biome recognizes browser and Node.js globals.
    You can ignore more globals using the javascript.globals configuration.
  

